Interview Time: 45 Mints

### Requirement Gathering (5-10 minutes)
- Scope the problem
- State your assumptions
- Functional and Non Function Side (NFR) ==> DSA 

### Identifying the entities of your system (10 mints)
- 10 - 15 entities 
- Relate these entities to your requirements

### Detail Design of the entities (20-25 mints)
- identify and go through the flows

- Indentify the relationships between entities
- Identify the attributes and behavious of the classes

Top to Bottom Approach: 
* 

Bottom To Top Approach: 
* Smallest entity has least number of attributes, behavious and relationships

### UML Diagram (5 Mints, Generally Not needed)


### Questions
* Extension problem
* Implementation problem
* Discussion of Design Principles
* Discussion about possibility of Design Patterns